YOD MTHA' [student repeats]
MED MTHA' [student repeats]

00:32:04.002 --> 00:32:07.294
YOD PA'I MTHA' This means an extreme statement:
His existence is...

00:32:07.294 --> 00:32:09.552
[student] From his own side.

00:32:09.552 --> 00:32:11.694
From his own side, not because I yell at the child.

00:32:11.694 --> 00:32:12.920
This is called...

